        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Henry Wiltshire Estate Agents are delighted to bring to the market 8 Millbank Square, Sallins, Co Kildare\r\n\r\nA spacious 2 Bedroom Ground-Floor Apartment in the Heart of Sallins\r\n\r\nA fantastic opportunity to acquire a spacious two-bedroom ground-floor apartment in the highly sought-after Millbank Square, right in the heart of Sallins Village.\r\n\r\nNo. 8 Millbank Square offers bright, comfortable and well-proportioned accommodation, with a large open-plan sitting room, kitchen and dining area creating a fantastic space for modern everyday living and entertaining.\r\n\r\nThe property comprises a welcoming entrance hall, large open-plan living/kitchen/dining area, two generous bedrooms and a main bathroom.\r\n\r\nThe ground-floor position adds convenience, while the central village location means local shops, cafés, restaurants and everyday amenities are all within easy reach.\r\n\r\nSallins Railway Station is within walking distance, making this an excellent choice for commuters, with convenient rail connections to Dublin. The Grand Canal is also nearby, offering scenic walking and cycling routes, while the M7 motorway is easily accessible.\r\n\r\nHighlights\r\nSpacious 2 bedroom apartment\r\nGround-floor position\r\nLarge open-plan sitting room, kitchen & dining area\r\nTwo generous bedrooms\r\nBright and comfortable accommodation\r\nExcellent village-centre location\r\nWalking distance to Sallins Railway Station\r\nClose to the Grand Canal\r\nEasy access to the M7\r\n\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is highly recommended."
      },
